<h2 style="color: #dc2626;">🚨 Batch Recall Notice 🚨</h2>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p><strong>ACTION REQUIRED:</strong> A crop batch associated with you has been <strong style="color: #dc2626;">recalled</strong> by the system administrators.</p>

<div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;">
    <p><span class="highlight">Batch ID:</span> {{batchId}}</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Crop Type:</span> {{cropType}}</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Quantity:</span> {{quantity}} kg</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Recalled By:</span> {{recalledBy}}</p>
    <p><span class="highlight">Time of Recall:</span> {{recalledAt}}</p>
</div>

<p>Please log in to your dashboard immediately to review the recall details and instructions on how to handle this batch.</p>

<a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button" style="background-color: #dc2626;">Review Recall Details</a>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact the administrators immediately.</p>
<p>— The CropChain Team</p>
